#====================================================================
# E236 - Verify Conan source-folder isolation before diagnosing mutation
#====================================================================

id:                     E311
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|review
phase:                  configuration|compilation
error_signature:        Copying sources to build folder|no_copy_source.*True|replace_in_file.*self.source_folder

severity:               2
category:               conan-source-folder-isolation
match_keywords:         replace_in_file, self.source_folder, no_copy_source, Copying sources to build folder, source cache, package ID, editable
title:                  Verify Conan source-folder isolation before diagnosing build-time mutation

root_cause:             With Conan 2's default no_copy_source=False, Conan copies sources into each package build folder and remaps self.source_folder before build(); treating that path as the shared cache creates a false contamination diagnosis. no_copy_source=True and editable workflows can have different sharing semantics and require explicit verification.
affected_scope:         Conan 2 recipes that edit self.source_folder from build(), especially reviews of shared/static package IDs, no_copy_source recipes, and editable builds.
verification_cmd:       Inspect the create log for Copying sources to build folder and distinct package build paths, then build two option variants and compare the canonical cache source hash before and after.

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           verify-or-enforce-source-isolation
rec_description:        First resolve the actual build-time self.source_folder and Conan copy policy. If the default per-package copy is present, record that evidence; when an explicit invariant is preferable, reset a nested copy under build_folder, edit only it, and configure from that path.
rec_command:            Confirm Copying sources to build folder and distinct build paths; optionally use rmdir/copy plus cmake.configure(build_script_folder=build_source).
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-conan-recipe-edit

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      source-phase-invariant-patch
fallback_description:   If an edit is identical for every package ID, move it to an exported source patch applied once in source(); keep option-dependent edits in the verified per-build source tree.
fallback_command:       Export and apply an invariant conandata patch from source(), then verify build-time option edits remain package-local.
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          source-patch

forbid_1_pattern:       self\.source_folder.*shared source cache
forbid_1_reason:        The variable name alone does not establish its runtime path or Conan's source-copy policy.
forbid_1_consequence:   A valid default per-package source copy can be misreported as a blocking cross-package contamination defect.

principles:             
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

doc_file:               doc/E311.md
last_updated:           2026-07-19
source_event:           iir1/1.10.0 source-folder review and sequential HarmonyOS PC builds

authors:                2301_80739235 <2047361658@qq.com>
